COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.drawn_principal IS '该客户已提用的贷款本金余额。';
COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.approved_limit IS '该客户已获批的授信额度上限。';
COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.monthly_inflow IS '客户当月账户资金流入额（元），用于评估还款能力。';
COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.inflow_12m_avg IS '近 12 个月月均资金流入额（元），用于平滑季节性波动。';
COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.consecutive_partial_count IS '连续部分还款次数（推测）；指连续出现未足额还款的期数，用于识别还款能力恶化。';
COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.paid_amount IS '当期已还款金额。';
