COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.collateral_ratio_prev IS '期初抵质押物覆盖率，即抵质押物价值与贷款余额之比。';
COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.collateral_ratio_curr IS '期末抵质押物覆盖率；较期初大幅下降视为担保弱化预警。';
COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.guarantee_status IS '担保状态：active 有效 / revoked 已撤销。';
COMMENT ON COLUMN platform.bank_ews_signal.other_facility_dpd_90plus IS '是否存在其他授信或他行贷款逾期 90 天以上（推测）；该信号用于跨机构风险预警。';
